==Description==
The '''StarryNight Nametag''' is a nametag that could be obtained at Level 38 of the regular [[Operation I.C.E Event#Operation I.C.E Event Battle Pass|Operation I.C.E Battle Pass]] track. At that Level, it costed {{Bell|1,360}} or {{Robux|106}} to unlock, with a total cost of {{Bell|24,220}} or {{Robux|4,402}}.

The '''StarryNight Nametag''' has dark blue, purple and blue text with a blue outline. Behind the text there is a dark blue mist accompanied by multiple blue and purple particles, and a few yellow stars.

